    <section class="story" id="story"><div class="wrap story-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE PIECES</p><h2>Built around<br>the <em>collector in you.</em></h2></div><div><p class="story-lead">Collecting is personal. So is JKR Vault.</p><p>We buy, sell, and trade sports cards, memorabilia, and collectibles to connect enthusiasts with the items they love. Whether you’re chasing a longtime favorite or making your first find, you’re welcome here.</p><a href="#connect" class="text-link">Let’s talk collecting ↗</a></div></div></section>
    <section class="journey wrap"><p class="eyebrow">FROM OUR VAULT TO YOUR COLLECTION</p><div class="steps"><article><span>01 / DISCOVER</span><h3>Find your connection.</h3><p>Explore our collecting interests, then visit eBay for available pieces or SportsCardsPro for the wider collection.</p></article><article><span>02 / LOOK CLOSER</span><h3>Know the piece.</h3><p>Review the actual item photos, condition notes, and listing details before you make your move.</p></article><article><span>03 / MAKE IT YOURS</span><h3>Continue on eBay.</h3><p>For available pieces, follow the listing to review the current price and complete your purchase on eBay.</p></article></div></section>
    <section class="connect wrap" id="connect"><div class="connect-card"><p class="eyebrow">THE COLLECTION CONTINUES</p><h2>More than what’s<br>on the shelf.</h2><p>Explore the wider JKR Vault collection on SportsCardsPro. Collection highlights may include pieces that aren’t for sale.</p><a class="button outline" data-link="sportscardspro" href="#connections">Explore the collection ↗</a></div><div class="connect-card light"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S TALK COLLECTING</p><h2>A piece to sell?<br>A trade in mind?</h2><p>Tell us what you have, its condition, and what you’re looking for. For an item listed on eBay, contact us through that listing.</p><a class="text-link" data-link="contact" href="#connections">Contact options ↗</a><p class="fine">Purchases from our eBay listings stay on eBay.</p></div></section>
    <section class="faq wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p><details><summary>Where do I buy an available item?</summary><p>Visit our eBay profile and open the item’s live listing. That listing is the source for price, availability, payment, shipping, and returns.</p></details><details><summary>Is everything in the collection for sale?</summary><p>No. Our SportsCardsPro collection can include personal holdings. The artwork here represents collecting interests. Visit our eBay profile to see what is currently offered for purchase. When individual pieces appear here, their availability will be labeled.</p></details><details><summary>Are all items graded or authenticated?</summary><p>Grading and authentication vary by item. Review the specific listing, photos, and any documented certification. eBay Authenticity Guarantee applies only to eligible listings where eBay displays it.</p></details></section>
